## Command Interface Guidelines

### Core Commands
```typescript
// Basic Navigation
> help           // Show available commands
> whoami         // Display current context
> search         // Timeline search
> share          // Content sharing
> fetch          // Content retrieval

// Mode Switching
> journal        // Notes/writing mode
> finance        // Financial tracking
> blog           // Publishing mode
> voice          // Audio interface
```

### Implementation Requirements

1. Habituating Design
   - Consistent command syntax
   - Predictable responses
   - Command history
   - Tab completion

2. Modeless Operation
   - Clear state indicators
   - Explicit mode transitions
   - Context preservation

3. Reliability
   - Command validation
   - Error recovery
   - State persistence
   - Undo support

